  "purpose": "One urban island faces a central Bellweather island, with a looping chain of mixed and outlying territories around them.",
  "departures": "Districts fill their islands: shared borders define adjacency for every effect, and only marked bridges connect across water. All three urban districts share one island. Bellweather occupies its own central island and connects to all three regions. The sheet is landscape A4 with a six-year tracker below the map.",
